     ssaaffttee — SCSI Accessed Fault-Tolerant Enclosure

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ssaaffttee** aatt ssccssiibbuuss??

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssaaffttee driver provides support for monitoring the various environmen‐
     tal sensors present in SCSI enclosures using the SCSI Accessed Fault-Tol‐
     erant Enclosure command set.  The hardware monitor is used with the
     sysctl(8) interface.

     SAF-TE compliant devices can provide an arbitrary set of sensors from the
     following types:

           SSeennssoorr    UUnniittss    TTyyppiiccaall UUssee
           temp      uK       temperature
           fan       RPM      fan
           psu       On/Off   power supply
           doorlock  On/Off   door lock
           alarm     On/Off   enclosure alarm

     Sensor data is updated every 10 seconds.

     An enclosure may provide environmental information using an alternative
     to the SCSI Accessed Fault-Tolerant Enclosure command set used by this
     driver.  Enclosures using the SCSI Enclosure Services command set may be
     monitored by the ses(4) driver.

